ow utilities","image optimization","AI-assisted productivity","ecommerce operations tools","technical writing for practical workflows"],"contactPoint":{"@type":"ContactPoint","email":"luowj1998@outlook.com","contactType":"customer support","availableLanguage":["English","Chinese"]},"publishingPrinciples":"https://toolorbit.site/about"}},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"ItemList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"url":"https://toolorbit.site/tools/text/text-analyzer","name":"Text Analyzer: Real-time Word & Character Counter","description":"Professional text statistics tool. Get deep insights into your content structure, from basic word counts to advanced character frequency analysis. Perfect for writers and editors."},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"url":"https://toolorbit.site/tools/text/text-cleaner","name":"Online Text Cleaner: Batch Remove Spaces & Punctuation","description":"Powerful utility to sanitize your text. Strip newlines, remove extra spaces, and filter out punctuation instantly. Essential for data cleanup and formatting."},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"url":"https://toolorbit.site/tools/text/symbol-library","name":"Symbols & Emoji Library: One-Click Web Copy & Paste","description":"When writing social media copy, product descriptions, documentation, comments, or UI mockups, finding the right special symbol often means jumping between input methods, search results, and operating-system emoji panels. This Symbol Library keeps frequently used Unicode characters in one searchable workspace: emoji, arrows, mathematical operators, currency marks, copyright symbols, decorative stars, brackets, and punctuation. Type a keyword, browse by category, then click any symbol to copy it directly to your clipboard. Because the entries are native Unicode characters rather than images, they remain selectable, lightweight, and easy to paste into HTML, Markdown, spreadsheets, design notes, chat messages, and plain text files. The library is especially useful for developers checking UI placeholders, content editors polishing headlines, students writing formulas, and ecommerce teams preparing compact listing copy."}]}]0:{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[[["$","template",null,{"id":"structured-data-category-text-tools","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$2"}}],"$L3"],["$L4","$L5"],"$L6"]}],"isPartial":false,"staleTime":300,"varyParams":null,"buildId":"bYYi-ZPGnf7tmCL1WLFhj"}
